OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FGiovanni Antonini directs his
OL,7,     Fensemble Il Giardino Armonico in
OL,8,     Fmusic by Vivaldi, Albinoni and
OL,9,     FHaydn at Melk Abbey on the banks
OL,10,     Fof the River Danube in Austria.
OL,11,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,12,     FA service from Blackburn
OL,13,     FCathedral, with music by Ed Jones,
OL,14,     FHowells, Martin Bussey and Vierne.
OL,15,G1900 Between the Ears: Silent Teachers
OL,16,     FComposer Jay Capperauld creates a
OL,17,     Fnew work inspired by these 'silent
OL,18,     Fteachers' the students who study
OL,19,     Fthem and the head anatomist who
OL,20,     Fholds an annual service for their
OL,21,     Ffamilies.
